  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "stop 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握 stop to do 与 stop doing 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) stop to do sth. 停下手中的动作，去做另外一件事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stopped to talk"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " with me. 他停下来跟我谈话。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) stop doing sth. 停下手中正在做的事情。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I want to ask my father to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stop smoking"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". 我想叫我的父亲戒烟。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3) stop … (from) doing sth. 阻止做某事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：No one can "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stop"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " me "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "from learning"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " English. 没有人能阻止我学习英语。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
